'''Monk Star armor''' is an art type available in the Prophecies campaign.

There is another variant of this armor art named [[Monk Dragon armor]]. 

The [[prestige armor|prestige]] versions of this armor are [[Monk Flowing armor]] and [[Monk Labyrinthine armor]].

'''Note''': The Star Scalp Design is only available without attribute bonus until Droknar's Forge (maximum armor rating). In Droknar's Forge it's available with all attribute bonuses for monks.

